  "objectiveTitle": "Objective",
  "objectiveDescription": "Matrix Puzzle is a deductive logic puzzle where you determine which resident lives on each floor of a building. Each puzzle features dynamic themes with different categories (such as Names, Pets, Hobbies, Drinks, Professions, Vehicles, Colors, Instruments, and Nationalities). Every floor has exactly one resident with one item from each category. Your goal is to deduce the full solution using the clues.",
  "clueTypesTitle": "Clue Types & Meanings",
  "clueSectionDirectTitle": "1. Direct & Parity Clues",
  "clueSectionDirectDesc": "These identify exact floor positions or numerical properties.",
  "exampleDirectClue1": "James lives on the 1st floor (Ground floor).",
  "exampleDirectMeaning1": "James is on Floor 1. Tap the Name cell on Floor 1 and select 'James'.",
  "exampleDirectClue2": "The Doctor lives on an odd-numbered floor.",
  "exampleDirectMeaning2": "The Doctor can only live on Floor 1, 3, 5, 7, etc.",
  "clueSectionAssociationTitle": "2. Association & Negative Clues",
  "clueSectionAssociationDesc": "These link or separate two characteristics belonging to residents.",
  "exampleAssocClue1": "Maria has a Cat.",
  "exampleAssocMeaning1": "Maria and Cat belong on the same floor.",
  "exampleAssocClue2": "Chen does not drink Coffee.",
  "exampleAssocMeaning2": "Chen and Coffee cannot be on the same floor.",
  "clueSectionNeighborTitle": "3. Neighbor & Relative Position",
  "clueSectionNeighborDesc": "These describe vertical positioning relationships between residents.",
  "exampleNeighborClue1": "Yuki lives directly above Ahmed.",
  "exampleNeighborMeaning1": "Yuki is on the immediate floor above Ahmed (Floor X + 1).",
  "exampleNeighborClue2": "Sofia lives on a floor adjacent to Dmitri.",
  "exampleNeighborMeaning2": "Sofia lives either directly above or directly below Dmitri (|Floor A - Floor B| = 1).",
  "exampleNeighborClue3": "The Pilot lives somewhere above the Chef.",
  "exampleNeighborMeaning3": "The Pilot lives on any higher floor than the Chef (Floor > X).",
  "clueSectionDistanceTitle": "4. Distance & Betweenness Clues",
  "clueSectionDistanceDesc": "Advanced clues that specify relative gaps and sandwich arrangements.",
  "exampleDistanceClue1": "Elena lives exactly 2 floors above Priya.",
  "exampleDistanceMeaning1": "Elena's floor is exactly Priya's floor + 2 (e.g., Floors 1 and 3, or Floors 3 and 5).",
  "exampleDistanceClue2": "Chen lives on a floor between Maria and the Architect.",
  "exampleDistanceMeaning2": "Chen's floor is strictly between Maria's floor and the Architect's floor.",
  "toolsAndControlsTitle": "Tools & Controls",
  "helpfulFeaturesTitle": "Helpful Features",
